spar3d-docker is an independent, unofficial launcher project.
The upstream source is retrieved during the container build; model weights
are obtained separately by the user at runtime. This repository does not
distribute model weights or prebuilt container images.

No changes are made to upstream source code by this project. The independently
authored launcher supplies command-line arguments and organizes input/output
files around the upstream command-line program. Container configuration pins
upstream and selected dependency versions. These wrapper contributions are
